// Status: test | Level: medium
// Author: Igor Fits, Mikhail Larin, oscd.community
// Date: 2020-10-19 | Modified: 2022-01-12
// ATT&CK: stealth, T1070.006
// Description: Detect file time attribute change to hide new or changes to existing files
// False positives:
//   - Unknown
// References:
//   - https://github.com/redcanaryco/atomic-red-team/blob/f339e7da7d05f6057fdfcdd3742bfcf365fee2a9/atomics/T1070.006/T1070.006.md
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/adf5a626c4a776f3f023056f0f398b9523a2f09e/rules/macos/process_creation/proc_creation_macos_change_file_time_attr.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language 12.4.1, live Defender schema)
// Machine-generated and not tested against real telemetry. Verify before use as a detection.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where FolderPath endswith "/touch" and (ProcessCommandLine contains "-t" or ProcessCommandLine contains "-acmr" or ProcessCommandLine contains "-d" or ProcessCommandLine contains "-r")
